# Second round of the same backlog, added 2026-09-05.
#
# Checked before suppressing: Terraform 1.15.5 -> 1.15.9 moves Go 1.25.9 to
# 1.25.10, and 1.16.1 to 1.26.4; Packer 1.15.3 -> 1.16.0 moves it to 1.26.3.
# These advisories need Go 1.25.13 / 1.26.6, so no released build clears them.
# Raising the versions is worth doing on its own merits — Terraform runs the
# App templates, so it belongs in a change we can verify — but it would not
# make these entries unnecessary.
#
